    "q-99664": {
      "dom_id": "step-q99664",
      "name": "Question 4",
      "problem": "Calculate ${lim}_{x\\to 4}{log}_{5}⁡(4-x).$",
      "worked_solution": "Let's sketch the graph of $y={log}_{5}⁡(4-x).$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14273970/assets/4c8119ac59d4fe8102a4d78e10f32f1b3f0116366001b6a78d256b3928867943.png)\n\nThe function is not defined for $x\\ge 4.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n{lim}_{x\\to {4}^{+}}{log}_{5}⁡(4-x)=\\text{DNE}.\n$$\n\nHowever, the function is defined for $x<4.$ Moreover,\n\n$$\n{lim}_{x\\to {4}^{-}}{log}_{5}⁡(4-x)=-\\infty .\n$$\n\nSince the left and right-sided limits are not equal, we have\n\n$$\n{lim}_{x\\to 4}{log}_{5}⁡(4-x)=\\text{DNE}.\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-99664-a",
              "type": "math",
              "value": "-\\infty ",
              "html": "<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"33\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c221E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>"
            },
            {
              "option": "b",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-99664-b",
